{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y在S13加入“越喜欢跟他待着，他越觉得时间过得快”，与后面害怕失去、想藏回心意的心理因果衔接不够清楚，反而削弱了这一段原本很重要的转折。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y的重点词加亮、话句拆短，让观众不用逐字读完也能抓住每段的心理变化；感受字较小且按音乐时机出现，也减少了与主叙事争夺注意力。X的完整句子在交代人物动机和因果关系上更稳、更准确，但右侧感受词容易成为一堆需要自行拼接的信息。整体而言，Y更适合边听边扫，且感受与音乐的结合更细腻，只需要修正少数心理逻辑不够严密的地方。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "ef29c6ff-5d02-4136-aec7-167fe552d279", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261107T193257493708Z", "elapsed_seconds": 142.922, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T19:35:20.419891+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "8e41b92a7eb734268f96d3244d5cd00d8ca6d19c870ba8bd28bb85a66bdf8cba", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_atta